<title>USA: Wachovia joins electronic commerce net.</title>
<headline>Wachovia joins electronic commerce net.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON SALEM, N.C. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Corp said it has joined CommerceNet Southeast, a consortium of businesses and state and local government agencies working on development and deployment of electronic commerce in a 10-state region of the U.S.</p>
<p>Wachovia, a $46.05 billion asset bank holding company, said it is the first financial institution to join the electronic network.</p>
